around and getting carried away!

292
00:23:36,740 --> 00:23:40,470
This thunder... It's the Rising Road!
Thunder King, Nue!

293
00:23:40,910 --> 00:23:45,720
What? You want me to be the leader of
the most powerful team, Mega Storm?!

294
00:23:45,890 --> 00:23:48,510
